{"title":"高山顶上人造江","alias":"","parts":[{"type":"title","text":"高山顶上人造江"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炮震山谷响四方，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"建设山区人人忙，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万丈深沟拦河水，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山顶上人造江，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳听江南好地方，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眼看我乡变苏杭。"}],"authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1958}],"is_range_date":false,"comments":[],"comment_pivots":[],"description":"（河南林县民歌）","page_start":10,"page_end":10}